OL,3,GNEWSACovid pandemic in care home 'soul
OL,4,Ashattering'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA care home manager described surviving
OL,7,Fthe Covid-19 pandemic as "soul
OL,8,Fshattering".
OL,10,FVicki Walker from Balmoral House in
OL,11,FScunthorpe recalled staff working 24
OL,12,Fhour shifts and sleeping at the home
OL,13,Fadding: "It was a case of saying
OL,14,Fgoodbye to your family and I'll be back
OL,15,Fwhen I get back."
OL,17,FHer comments came after the Covid
OL,18,Finquiry published a highly critical
OL,19,Freport on the way the government tried
OL,20,Fto protect people in care settings in
OL,21,Fthe UK.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,385,380,200,160,0,100
