OL,3,GNEWSACovid pandemic in care home 'soul
OL,4,Ashattering'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBaroness Hallett found the pandemic
OL,7,F"totally disrupted" the lives of people
OL,8,Fin care homes and had a "devastating
OL,9,Fimpact", with more than 43,000 deaths
OL,10,Finvolving Covid between March 2020 and
OL,11,FJuly 2022.
